    "Synthetic fixture (NOT recorded from the device). Site-a's terminal is in pure",
    "access-control mode, so `attendanceStatus` is absent/null on every real event",
    "(OBSERVED.md) and no checkIn/checkOut can be captured today. This file carries the",
    "attendance-mode shape (docs/references/acs-event-codes.md section 4) so the",
    "direction rule and its round trip are covered offline before the owner enables",
    "attendance mode (DESIGN.md option A).",
    "expected_direction is what gateclerk.model must produce: only checkIn/checkOut set a",
    "direction, everything else (breakIn/breakOut/overtime*/undefined/custom) is kept",
    "verbatim as attendance_status with direction=unknown. expected_source is the",
    "direction_source value ('device' or 'none') - 'inferred' is never expected: P1 does",
    "not infer direction anywhere.",
    "Masking policy as everywhere: no real names, serials, nonces or credentials."
